# UI copy (RU / EN)

All user-visible interface strings live in [`apps/web/src/lib/app-language.ts`](apps/web/src/lib/app-language.ts).

When the user edits **Russian** (`STRINGS.ru` / keys in `UiStrings`):

1. Update the matching **English** key in `STRINGS.en` in the same change.
2. Keep meaning aligned; do not leave EN on an older wording.
3. New keys: add to `UiStrings`, then `ru` and `en`.
4. Prefer committing RU+EN together so production/APK never ship mismatched languages.

Do not hardcode button/label text in TSX when a `t.*` key already exists or should be added.
